codex
The root cause is now concrete: processes report an inner PID (for example `2`), while the mounted `/proc` exposes outer PIDs, so Lean’s hard-coded `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` lookup fails. I’m applying a narrow audit-local compatibility shim that maps only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean sources, generated files, or theorem behavior. I’ll preserve the shim source and compile/run logs as evidence.
apply patch
